1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,100
A single SVG is all PurgeTSS needs to brand
a Titanium Classic project.

2
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:09,950
From the integrated terminal, run:
purgetss brand --yes.

3
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:15,043
The command creates every branding asset for the
enabled iOS and Android platforms.

4
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:19,900
The iOS splash set now rounds only the artwork,
while the master icon stays square.

5
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:26,243
Android applies the same radius to its main launch image
and every density and orientation variant.

6
00:00:28,700 --> 00:00:31,100
Feature Graphic gets the same rounded artwork.

7
00:00:31,450 --> 00:00:34,680
Store and launcher icons stay square
for platform masking.

8
00:00:35,100 --> 00:00:39,900
That is PurgeTSS: one logo, one command,
and every branding asset.
